  m_text: "<color=#9FD0FF>public class SoundManager : MonoBehaviour {\n  public static SoundManager Instance;\n  [SerializeField] Sound[] sounds; // \uC774\uB984 + \uD074\uB9BD\n  void Awake() {\n    if (Instance != null) { Destroy(gameObject); return; }\n    Instance = this; DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject);\n  }\n  public static void Play(string name) { \u2026 }\n}</color>\n\n\u2022 \uC774\uB984\u2192\uD074\uB9BD \uB515\uC154\uB108\uB9AC, AudioSource \uD480 8\uAC1C \uB3CC\uB824\uC4F0\uAE30\n\u2022 \uD638\uCD9C \uCABD: <b>SoundManager.Play(\"Hit\");</b> \uD55C \uC904\n\u2022 \uC624\uD0C0\uB294 \uACBD\uACE0 \uB85C\uADF8 (enum \uC774\uB098 const string \uC73C\uB85C \uB9C9\uC744 \uC218\uB3C4)"
